  ],
  teal: [
    'A BSc Agriculture graduate going into research, extension, agribusiness, or agri-input sales earns a salary independent of that season\'s rainfall or crop price — the same structural difference as any other salaried professional career.',
    'Government agriculture jobs (extension officer, ARS scientist, bank agricultural field officer) come with fixed pay scales, allowances, and pension exposure that a landholding farmer\'s income structure does not have.',
    'Agribusiness, agritech, and private agri-input roles pay market-linked salaries tied to the company\'s revenue and the person\'s performance, not to whether it rained on time in their specific district.',
  ],
};

