    Vacancy counts, exam cycles, and pay scales change by year and by state. Verify current ASRB, state PSC, and
    IBPS notifications directly before anchoring a plan on any single number in this article, including these.
  </p>

  <h2 id="agribusiness-agritech">Agribusiness, agri-MBA, and agritech startups</h2>

  <p>
    This is the fastest-growing and, for many graduates, the most financially rewarding branch of the field right
    now — precision farming, agri-fintech, farm-to-market supply chains, and agri-marketing are all real, expanding
    problem areas that India genuinely needs solved.
  </p>

  <div class="track-grid">
    {agribusinessCards.map((card) => (
